# TUI Design & UX Rules

Referensi lengkap: `docs/design-system.md`, `docs/pages.md`.

## Layout — Center, Not Top-Crammed

- Konten **vertikal di tengah** viewport jika lebih pendek dari `contentHeight()`.
- Gunakan `components.CenterInViewport(content, width, height)` — jangan manual padding newline.
- Home (multi-section) **tidak** di-center; pakai scroll `j/k`.
- Header + sidebar + footer tetap fixed; hanya area konten yang di-center.

```go
// ✅ GOOD — center short screens
view := components.CenterInViewport(clipped, contentWidth, m.contentHeight())

// ❌ BAD — content menempel atas saat viewport besar
return styles.ContentStyle.Render(content)
```

## Responsiveness

- Semua render function terima `width` / `height`; jangan asumsikan 80×24.
- Breakpoints: `<40` tiny · `<60` compact · `<80` normal · `≥80` full.
- Tiny: sembunyikan marquee, FIGlet, equalizer; tampilkan wordmark saja.
- Wrap teks dengan `lipgloss.Width()`; jangan biarkan line overflow.
- Card/list: stack vertikal di `<60` cols; inline tags di `≥60`.

## Navigation — Instant Screen Switch

| Key | Aksi |
|-----|------|
| `↑` / `↓` | **Langsung ganti screen** (sidebar tabs) — tanpa Enter |
| `j` / `k` | Scroll konten, atau pilih item di list (Projects, Blog) |
| `Enter` | Drill-down: project detail, artikel blog |
| `←` / `Esc` | Back: detail → list, screen → Home, Home → quit |

- `↑↓` **bukan** scroll — scroll hanya `j/k` atau PgUp/PgDn.
- Saat ganti screen: `resetScroll()`, sync `selectedMenu` dengan screen aktif.
- Footer hint harus reflect: `↑↓ Screens` · `j/k Scroll` · `Enter Open`.

## Footer — Brand Kiri, Nav Kanan

Satu baris di paling bawah:

```
habibiahmada.          ↑↓ Screens · j/k Scroll · Enter Open · ← Back · ? Help · q Quit
```

- Brand (`habibiahmada.`) **selalu kiri**, hints **kanan**, spacer responsif di tengah.
- Jangan stack artline di atas hints — brand + hints **satu row** via `FooterBar`.
- Equalizer/cursor opsional hanya jika `width ≥ 70` dan muat di sisi kiri setelah brand.

## Blog — Live Fetch + TUI Format

- Fetch `GET {base}/api/public/blog` saat masuk screen Blog (Bubble Tea `tea.Cmd`).
- Base URL: env `HABIBIAHMADA_API_BASE` → default `https://www.habibiahmada.dev`.
- **Jangan** render markdown mentah — parse ke format TUI via `blog.FormatMarkdown(body, width)`.
- Tampilkan: title, category badge, date, read time, tags, body terformat.
- List: judul + meta satu baris; detail: section headers + body scroll `j/k`.
- Loading / error / empty state wajib — jangan blank screen.

## Styling

- Palette brand: primary `#ef4444`, secondary `#3b82f6` — lihat `docs/design-system.md`.
- Section label: `// Label` via `styles.LabelStyle`.
- Semua styling di `internal/styles/` — no raw ANSI di screen files.

## QA Checklist (setiap screen baru)

- [ ] 40×12, 60×20, 80×24, 120×40 — tidak overflow/clip aneh
- [ ] Konten pendek ter-center
- [ ] `↑↓` ganti screen tanpa Enter
- [ ] Footer brand kiri + hints kanan
